==Acquisition==
*This mod is acquired by attaining the rank of '''Wise''' with {{Faction|Cephalon Suda}}, and spending {{sc|25,000}} to purchase.

==Notes==
*Combined with {{M|Whirlwind}} it is able to reach a flight speed of 126 m/s, which is faster than the {{Weapon|Glaive Prime}} with Whirlwind, which attains a speed of 112 m/s.

